{%- comment -%}
  SAFAA type system. Newsreader (display) / Archivo (data & labels) / Amiri (Arabic), all OFL
  and self-hosted as theme assets — no visitor IP reaches a third-party font CDN, which is a
  settled GDPR problem and an avoidable one for a brand whose pitch is compliance discipline.

  Subsetting note: the static site splits latin / latin-ext per family. Here the latin files
  cover the storefront's Latin content and Amiri is scoped to the Arabic range, so a Latin
  page never downloads the Arabic face.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preload" href="{{ 'newsreader-latin-400-500-n.woff2' | asset_url }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" href="{{ 'archivo-latin-400-900-n.woff2' | asset_url }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<style>
@font-face{font-family:'Newsreader';font-style:normal;font-weight:400 500;font-display:swap;
  src:url({{ 'newsreader-latin-400-500-n.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2')}
@font-face{font-family:'Newsreader';font-style:italic;font-weight:400 500;font-display:swap;
  src:url({{ 'newsreader-latin-400-500-i.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2')}
@font-face{font-family:'Archivo';font-style:normal;font-weight:400 900;font-stretch:100%;font-display:swap;
  src:url({{ 'archivo-latin-400-900-n.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2')}
@font-face{font-family:'Amiri';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;
  src:url({{ 'amiri-arabic-400-n.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
  unicode-range:U+0600-06FF,U+0750-077F,U+08A0-08FF,U+FB50-FDFF,U+FE70-FEFF}
@font-face{font-family:'Amiri';font-style:normal;font-weight:700;font-display:swap;
  src:url({{ 'amiri-arabic-700-n.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
  unicode-range:U+0600-06FF,U+0750-077F,U+08A0-08FF,U+FB50-FDFF,U+FE70-FEFF}
@font-face{font-family:'Amiri';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;
  src:url({{ 'amiri-latin-400-n.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2')}
</style>
